section.screen.d-none#screen-orders
  #ordersLoggedOut.container.py-5.d-none(style="max-width:880px")
    .text-center.py-5
      +cakeIcon(88)
      h2.h4 Log in to see your orders
      p.text-body-secondary.mx-auto(style="max-width:40ch") Once you're signed in, every cake you order will show up here with live status.
      button.btn.btn-primary.rounded-pill.px-4(type="button", onclick="go('login')") Log in

  #ordersLoggedIn.container.py-5.d-none(style="max-width:880px")
    .mb-4
      h1.h2 My orders
      p#ordersSubtitle.text-body-secondary.mb-0 Everything you've ordered from us.
    #ordersList
